    {
      "text": "The famotidine products at Corvale East, Corvale General, and Corvale Lakeside are labeled by Northwind Health Company, LLC with NDC 51655031220 and SPL set ID ab1cdbbf-d838-020c-e053-2995a90a0f65.",
