    {
      "text": "The registered plant for this label is Northwind Health Company, LLC (FEI 1831143) in the USA performing REPACK operations.",
      "cites": ["E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 952157 of Northwind Pharmaceuticals LLC (FEI 1831143) ended on 2015-12-09 and was classified OAI, with a known date of 2016-03-08.",
      "cites": ["E6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The most recent FDA inspection 1256379 ended on 2025-09-26 and was classified VAI, with a known date of 2025-12-04.",
      "cites": ["E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale Lakeside holds 14 units at 1.7 per day, giving 8 days on hand, while Corvale General holds 257 units at 9.7 per day, giving 26 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Transferring 10 units from Corvale General to Corvale Lakeside would leave Corvale General with 247 units (25 days on hand) and bring Corvale Lakeside to 24 units (14 days on hand).",
